    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Vs. Zombie 3 is an action survival hack and slash game the graphics are a mix of retro and 3D. Play a ninja who has to fight against countless waves of zombies and monsters, defeat the deepest evil the zombie king and his guards and stop the virus or be a loser you decide every time you fall the world loses hope. Use your weapons to split zombies or monsters into pieces or blast them away. Unlock upgrades that are required to defeat the undead faster and more effectively. When you die you only keep your upgrades but you always start from the beginning there are only 2 checkpoints in the game. Collect healing and items as much as you can to survive, block or teleport yourself with your smoke bombs at the right moment to avoid dying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346990/extras/0e4c2957e37a7f86bd6101c0e3361324.poster.avif?t=1743563503\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346990/extras/0e4c2957e37a7f86bd6101c0e3361324.webm?t=1743563503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346990/extras/0e4c2957e37a7f86bd6101c0e3361324.mp4?t=1743563503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the best on Steam Leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive all Waves of the Evil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Upgrades and keep forever. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing, Bombs and looting Skills. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smoke bombs teleportation and throwing Stars permanently available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fill up your Combination level to activate your Revenge mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open 2 Swords Revenge Mode and Double Damage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Sword slashes with Kicks.\u00a0\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice Zombies and Monsters with force in every direction. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic thinking is necessary to Survive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Bosses with\u00a0specific attack patterns. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poison spitting Bosses with stacking Damage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346990/extras/fdd5a6b2f1a706190b99663bb3858138.avif?t=1743563503\" width=617 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346990/extras/4dea8acf5089fb8a148009bffc67a38a.avif?t=1743563503\" data-has-big width=800 height=636 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346990/extras/ca1c1cc8a0a0dc79180206049cbd71e1.avif?t=1743563503\" data-has-big width=800 height=636 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346990/extras/8b63638fca7ace13295102283bf09e46.avif?t=1743563503\" width=465 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bonus feature: be a zombie killer every 10 minutes of playing time your zombie kills will be transferred to the Steam leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
